{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The placement attribute indicates whether something is above or below another element, such as a note or a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"notation."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/placement","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"placement"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAboveBelow","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLAboveBelow","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLAboveBelowO"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"placement"},{"text":" attribute.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo\/placement"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"placement","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL10MXLTremoloV9placementAA13MXLAboveBelowOSgvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"placement"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLAboveBelowO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLAboveBelow"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTremolo":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTremolo"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTremolo"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo","title":"MXLTremolo","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tremolo ornament can be used to indicate single-note, double-note, or unmeasured tremolos. Single-note"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tremolos use the single type, double-note tremolos use the start and stop types, and unmeasured tremolos use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the unmeasured type. The default is “single” for compatibility with Version 1.1. The text of the element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicates the number of tremolo marks and is an integer from 0 to 8. Note that the number of attached beams is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not included in this value, but is represented separately using the beam element. The value should be 0 for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unmeasured tremolos."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTremolo/placement":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo\/placement","abstract":[{"text":"The placement attribute indicates whether something is above or below another element, such as a note or a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"notation.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/placement","title":"placement","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"placement"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLAboveBelow","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLAboveBelowO"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAboveBelow":{"title":"MXLAboveBelow","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"text":" ","kin